  "title": "Lotor v1.0.0: A local-first, tamper-evident receipt and gate layer for AI agent sessions",
  "description": "Lotor writes a signed, hash-chained record of what an AI agent did during a session and gates chosen tool calls behind an Ed25519 signature the agent cannot forge. Local-first: the record is written to the user's machine and nowhere else, with no account, server component, or upload path. v1.0.0.",
